<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

	<!--
		CE-only replacement gun for the summoned sentry turret.

		WHY THIS EXISTS
		Under CE the turret would otherwise keep firing DMS_SubMachineGunMounted, which core's
		CE patch gives a 300-round .22LR CompAmmoUser. Building_TurretGunCE.SpawnSetup only
		auto-fills a magazine when:

		    if (!everSpawned && (!Map.IsPlayerHome || Faction != Faction.OfPlayer))
		        compAmmo?.ResetAmmoCount();

		So an enemy magier's turret spawns loaded, but the PLAYER's turret - summoned on the
		player's home map, owned by the player - falls through both clauses and spawns with an
		EMPTY magazine. A psycast-summoned, self-destructing 12-hour turret that has to be
		hand-fed .22LR before it will fire even once is not a usable ability.

		This def is identical to core's CE-patched mounted SMG except that it deliberately
		declares no CompProperties_AmmoUser. Building_TurretGunCE is null-safe about that
		(`Reloadable => CompAmmo?.HasMagazine ?? false`, `EmptyMagazine => CompAmmo?.EmptyMagazine
		?? false`), so the turret simply fires without an ammo pool. It stays time-limited by its
		CompProperties_MechPowerCell battery, which is where the limit belongs - the construct's
		"ammunition" is the psychic crystal, not a magazine anyone loaded.

		The gun the mech version uses is left untouched, so the Hyrax keeps its .22LR ammo.
	-->
	<ThingDef ParentName="BaseAutoTurretGun">
		<defName>DMST_Gun_SentryConstruct</defName>
		<label>sentry construct gun</label>
		<description>The weapon half of an assembled sentry construct. It has no magazine to speak of - rounds condense out of the same crystallised entropy that holds the frame together, and stop when that runs out.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Turrets/DMS_Gun_LMG</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<drawSize>1</drawSize>
		</graphicData>
		<statBases>
			<Mass>3.25</Mass>
			<Bulk>4.16</Bulk>
			<SwayFactor>0.96</SwayFactor>
			<ShotSpread>0.15</ShotSpread>
			<SightsEfficiency>1.0</SightsEfficiency>
			<RangedWeapon_Cooldown>1</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
		</statBases>
		<verbs>
			<li Class="CombatExtended.VerbPropertiesCE">
				<verbClass>CombatExtended.Verb_ShootCE</verbClass>
				<hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
				<defaultProjectile>Bullet_22LR_FMJ</defaultProjectile>
				<warmupTime>0.8</warmupTime>
				<range>20</range>
				<ticksBetweenBurstShots>3</ticksBetweenBurstShots>
				<burstShotCount>10</burstShotCount>
				<soundCast>Shot_MachinePistol</soundCast>
				<soundCastTail>GunTail_Medium</soundCastTail>
				<muzzleFlashScale>9</muzzleFlashScale>
				<recoilAmount>0.63</recoilAmount>
				<recoilPattern>Mounted</recoilPattern>
				<targetParams>
					<canTargetLocations>true</canTargetLocations>
				</targetParams>
			</li>
		</verbs>
		<weaponTags>
			<li>NoSwitch</li>
		</weaponTags>
	</ThingDef>

</Defs>
